From 1cf8ea72e5c2dab01fda6eec0e1f6731ca774600 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justus Bergermann <justus.bergermann@mpi-sp.org>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:45:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] riscv: dts: k230: describe all raw PMU events of the C908

The raw-event-to-mhpmcounters property only listed a subset of the
performance monitoring events supported by the XuanTie C908 core, so
the remaining events could not be used through the SBI PMU extension.

Replace it with a complete list based on Table 14.6 of the XuanTie
C908 user manual. Each of the 165 defined events (0x01-0xb4) gets its
own entry with a full select mask, mapped to mhpmcounter3-31. Indices
the manual marks as "Not defined" are omitted, so they are rejected
rather than programmed into a counter.
